{{Term/Store|Ironshroom|Ironshrooms|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Ironshroom}}
Ironshrooms can be found near [[Tree]]s in the [[Necluda]] [[Region]]. They are sold at the [[Spore Store]] in the [[Korok Forest]] and [[Ardin]]'s [[Stall]] in [[Gerudo Town]]. Ironshrooms can be made into [[Toasty Ironshroom]]s by being exposed to [[Fire]]. They can also be used in a [[Cooking Pot]] to create [[Food]] that grants [[Link]] [[Defense Up]], which increases his defense.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> At the [[Kochi Dye Shop]], Ironshrooms can be used to make Brown [[Dye]].

